Marker PNG assets — third-party attribution
============================================

The emoji artwork composited into the marker PNGs in this directory
(assets/markers/*.png) is taken from the Noto Emoji project by Google.

  Project : Noto Emoji
  Source  : https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji
            (2D/png/512/emoji_u*.png)
  Author  : Copyright 2013 Google LLC
  License : SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
            https://scripts.sil.org/OFL
            Full text: https://github.com/googlefonts/noto-emoji/blob/main/LICENSE

The coloured discs, rings and the user-location arrow/paw around the emoji
are original artwork generated by scripts/gen-marker-pngs.ts and are part of
this project.

How these files are produced
----------------------------
scripts/gen-marker-pngs.ts draws the disc/ring geometry with @napi-rs/canvas
(a build-time devDependency) and composites the Noto Emoji PNGs on top. The
Noto Emoji source PNGs are fetched at generate time and cached under
scripts/.emoji-cache/ (git-ignored); neither the emoji font nor the cache is
bundled into the shipped app — only the finished marker PNGs here are.
